    191  0969							;------------------------------------------------------------- interrupts
    192  0969							; Every 1/3 ms: feed the ACIA one byte (fast path). Every third time (1 ms):
    193  0969							; count a tick and move paced messages onto the wire.
    194  0969				   Irq
    195  0969					      subroutine
    196  0969		       48		      pha
    197  096a		       8a		      txa
    198  096b		       48		      pha
